    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/extras/ea6d2df8c3b8bbb10074802e58bfa73b.avif?t=1750867731\" data-has-big width=800 height=195 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years ago, your mentor and gentleman scientist Dr. A. Priori said that he would one day need your help, and that day has finally arrived. You've received a letter from the Professor asking you to finish what he could not. But finish what? And what are these strange devices?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/extras/77b0027443d4e1ed7d89836a1ddc9538.poster.avif?t=1750867731\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/extras/77b0027443d4e1ed7d89836a1ddc9538.webm?t=1750867731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/extras/77b0027443d4e1ed7d89836a1ddc9538.mp4?t=1750867731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a whole building and unlock rooms full of mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use time bubbles to change the environment, solve puzzles and unravel the mystery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/extras/11f1025ada61f7add3d467fe06468eb8.poster.avif?t=1750867731\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/extras/11f1025ada61f7add3d467fe06468eb8.webm?t=1750867731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/extras/11f1025ada61f7add3d467fe06468eb8.mp4?t=1750867731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play this first-person puzzle escape room game solo or co-op with up to 4 players.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/extras/ea6d2df8c3b8bbb10074802e58bfa73b.avif?t=1750867731\" data-has-big width=800 height=195 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years ago, your mentor and gentleman scientist Dr. A. Priori said that he would one day need your help, and that day has finally arrived. You've received a letter from the Professor asking you to finish what he could not. But finish what? And what are these strange devices?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/extras/77b0027443d4e1ed7d89836a1ddc9538.poster.avif?t=1750867731\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/extras/77b0027443d4e1ed7d89836a1ddc9538.webm?t=1750867731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/extras/77b0027443d4e1ed7d89836a1ddc9538.mp4?t=1750867731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a whole building and unlock rooms full of mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use time bubbles to change the environment, solve puzzles and unravel the mystery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/extras/11f1025ada61f7add3d467fe06468eb8.poster.avif?t=1750867731\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/extras/11f1025ada61f7add3d467fe06468eb8.webm?t=1750867731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143000/extras/11f1025ada61f7add3d467fe06468eb8.mp4?t=1750867731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play this first-person puzzle escape room game solo or co-op with up to 4 players.</p>",
